// Pipit Hatch body: an early-80s three-door compact hatchback.
//
// Intent: small, square and eager. A short flat nose with a slot grille between single
// rectangular lamps, a low hood, an upright windshield, a long flat roof and a steep
// hatch glass over a short squared tail. Black plastic bumpers, black window frames and
// arch lips, a tape stripe low on the doors, a lip on the hatch and five-spoke alloys.
// Generic period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
// docs/VEHICLES.md and crates/vehicle/src/shape/params.rs.
